                              "opacity": 1,
                              "stroke": "$border",
                              "context": "Catalog supplied by user. Voxtype q4f16 ~1.5 GB; FP16 ~3.9 GB. RAM ~2–4+ GB. CPU capable, GPU optional. Strong punctuation, casing and inverse text normalization. Purpose is a concise interpretation of the supplied characteristics. Available to download.",
