                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "i4ivM",
                      "name": "Models Content",
                      "context": "Cloud settings for the sole OpenAI provider. Provider selector is disabled. Below the separator: user API key, connection status, default mode, final/live display-model selectors, language detection, and expanded Advanced settings for expected languages and optional transcription context. Model names are the user-supplied display labels; implementation must map them to supported API model IDs.",
