      "context": "Selectable radio tile for the dictation window position (one of six in a 3x2 grid: top/bottom by left/center/right). The Position Preview is a miniature screen; the Position Marker sits where the window appears. Unselected: content-bg fill, 1px border, muted marker, primary label. Selected: accent-soft fill, 2px accent stroke, accent marker and label. Keyboard focus shows a focus ring. Accessible label: the position name, e.g. Top center.",
