      "context": "Open menu above the status bar STT Model Select, aligned to its left edge. Lists the downloaded models in catalog order with a check on the active one (accent-soft row, accent label), then Browse models (opens the Browse tab). A downloaded model that no runtime in this version can run is still listed, but muted with a No runtime hint at the right, and cannot be chosen. There is no No model row: the selection only changes by choosing another model. With nothing downloaded the model rows are replaced by a note, No models downloaded yet, that cannot be chosen (muted, not interactive). Choosing a row closes the menu; clicking anywhere else closes it too. Models are listed alphabetically by name; the active one is marked with a check, not moved.",
