    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "b9OE5C",
      "x": 2268,
      "y": -388,
      "name": "Confirm Dialog",
      "context": "Modal confirmation, one at a time, centered over the window. Buttons share the width equally in this order: primary (default action), secondary, Cancel. Neutral answers (secondary, Cancel) have a placeholder fill and border so they read as buttons, not links. A destructive action (delete, clear, quit) uses the danger color for its label, border and soft fill; the safe choice stays neutral or accent. Hover tints the fill with no animation. Every button shows the hand cursor. Disable the secondary button for a two-button dialog.",
      "reusable": true,
      "width": 440,
      "fill": "$content-bg",
      "cornerRadius": 8,
      "stroke": "$border",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "effect": {
        "type": "shadow",
