      "name": "Process List Item",
      "context": "One saved post-processing process in the list. Shows its position in its shortcut's group, its name, the optional short description and the model it uses. The shortcut is not repeated on the card: the group header above it shows it. The whole card opens the process on the edit screen (there is no chevron); the grip and the move buttons reorder it inside its group. A process whose model is not downloaded or cannot run shows a warning icon in the model row. A process without an instruction shows a second warning row (Process Warning Row) and is skipped when a chain runs. Every card has an on/off switch (Process Enabled Toggle) before the move buttons.",
