      "context": "Heads one group of the Post Processing list: every process that shares one shortcut. The key pill is the shortcut; the right side says what happens when it is pressed. The dictation shortcut's group also names it (Start dictation) and starts with the Dictation step. The last group has no key and holds processes without a shortcut.",
