    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "n3MUs1",
      "x": 2760,
      "y": 16600,
      "name": "Prompt Instruction States",
      "context": "The instruction field in its states. There are two variables: {{original}} is what the speech model heard, the same in every process of the chain; {{processed}} is the result of the process before this one, and in the first process it is the same as the original. Both are optional. With neither, the previous result is added after the instruction on a new line. The instruction is optional: a process without one is skipped when a chain runs, and Save is only disabled while the name is empty.",
      "theme": {
        "mode": "light"
      },
