    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "IOuL5",
      "x": 2100,
      "y": -2640,
      "name": "Command Set List Item",
      "context": "One command set in the Voice Commands list: a shortcut's decision step. When its shortcut is pressed, Rambl dictates, runs the post-processing processes on the same shortcut, then the decision model (such as Laya) picks the one command of this set that matches what was said and Rambl presses its keys. Shows the name, the optional short description, the model and the number of commands; the commands themselves are only on the set's edit screen. The whole card opens the set on its edit screen; the switch turns it on or off at once (off: dimmed with the Disabled tag, its shortcut only dictates and post-processes). A set whose model is missing, not downloaded or cannot run, or that has no commands, shows the warning row and counts for Needs attention.",
