                          "context": "Checks the set without pressing anything: the typed phrase goes straight to the model with the commands as they are on screen (unsaved edits included); post-processing is skipped. The result names the command the model picks with its key press and score, or says nothing was sure enough, and lists the runner-up so similar descriptions can be told apart. Disabled while the model is not usable or there are no commands.",
